     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><div>Dear TMB users,</div><div><br></div><div>I&#39;m recently facing Na/Nan problem<div style=\"background-color:rgb(250,250,250);border-color:rgb(187,187,187);border-style:solid;border-width:1px;word-wrap:break-word\"><code><div><span style=\"color:#606\">In</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> nlminb</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">model$par</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> model$fn</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> model$gr</span><span style=\"color:#660\">):</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> NA</span><span style=\"color:#660\">/</span><span style=\"color:#008\">NaN</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#008\">function</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> evaluation</span></div></code></div><br>after compiling my TMB code and I just found the example named nan_error_ex.R (for debugging purpose) from the following sites:</div><div><br></div><div><a href=\"https://kaskr.github.io/adcomp/Introduction.html%5D(https://kaskr.github.io/adcomp/Introduction.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://kaskr.github.io/adcomp/Introduction.html%255D(https://kaskr.github.io/adcomp/Introduction.html&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792462477694000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3CoENsv-p79p2WNUwAZ_3E\">https://kaskr.github.io/adcomp/Introduction.html](https://kaskr.github.io/adcomp/Introduction.html</a></div><div><a href=\"https://github.com/kaskr/adcomp/blob/master/tmb_syntax/nan_error_ex.R\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://github.com/kaskr/adcomp/blob/master/tmb_syntax/nan_error_ex.R&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792462477694000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2qzHUq-XTLwVs3YbF3rhfB\">https://github.com/kaskr/adcomp/blob/master/tmb_syntax/nan_error_ex.R</a></div><div><br></div><div>At first, I download the &lt;fenv.h&gt; file from the site and then inserted this the code:</div><div><div style=\"background-color:rgb(250,250,250);border-color:rgb(187,187,187);border-style:solid;border-width:1px;word-wrap:break-word\"><code><div><span style=\"color:#000\">feenableexcept</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">FE_INVALID </span><span style=\"color:#660\">|</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> FE_OVERFLOW </span><span style=\"color:#660\">|</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> FE_DIVBYZERO </span><span style=\"color:#660\">|</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> FE_UNDERFLOW</span><span style=\"color:#660\">);</span></div></code></div><br></div><div>(of course, I also included fenv.h also by adding <div style=\"background-color:rgb(250,250,250);border-color:rgb(187,187,187);border-style:solid;border-width:1px;word-wrap:break-word\"><code><div><span style=\"color:#800\">#include</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&lt;fenv.h&gt;</span></div></code></div><br> to the next line of <div style=\"background-color:rgb(250,250,250);border-color:rgb(187,187,187);border-style:solid;border-width:1px;word-wrap:break-word\"><code><div><span style=\"color:#800\">#include</span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;</span><span style=\"color:#000\">TMB</span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#000\">hpp</span><span style=\"color:#660\">&gt;</span></div></code></div><br>)</div><div><br></div><div>Since the first trial did not work, I decided to try the example code (both nan_error_ex.R and nan_error_ex.cpp) from <a href=\"https://github.com/kaskr/adcomp/tree/master/tmb_syntax\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://github.com/kaskr/adcomp/tree/master/tmb_syntax&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792462477694000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0jT4o6qzxj0h-xilYrrLpD\">https://github.com/kaskr/adcomp/tree/master/tmb_syntax</a><br></div><div><br></div><div>But the result was not different from the first trial: </div><div><br></div><div style=\"background-color:rgb(250,250,250);border-color:rgb(187,187,187);border-style:solid;border-width:1px;word-wrap:break-word\"><code><div><span style=\"color:#000\">nan_error_ex</span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#000\">cpp</span><span style=\"color:#660\">:</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#606\">In</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> member </span><span style=\"color:#008\">function</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#080\">&#39;Type objective_function&lt;Type&gt;::operator()()&#39;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">:</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br><br>nan_error_ex</span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#000\">cpp</span><span style=\"color:#660\">:</span><span style=\"color:#066\">7</span><span style=\"color:#660\">:</span><span style=\"color:#066\">72</span><span style=\"color:#660\">:</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> error</span><span style=\"color:#660\">:</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> there are </span><span style=\"color:#008\">no</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> arguments to </span><span style=\"color:#080\">&#39;feenableexcept&#39;</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> that depend on a </span><span style=\"color:#008\">template</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> parameter</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> so a declaration of </span><span style=\"color:#080\">&#39;feenableexcept&#39;</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> must be available </span><span style=\"color:#660\">[-</span><span style=\"color:#000\">fpermissive</span><span style=\"color:#660\">]</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>   feenableexcept</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">FE_INVALID </span><span style=\"color:#660\">|</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> FE_OVERFLOW </span><span style=\"color:#660\">|</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> FE_DIVBYZERO </span><span style=\"color:#660\">|</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> FE_UNDERFLOW</span><span style=\"color:#660\">);</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#800\">// Extra line needed</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>                                                                        </span><span style=\"color:#660\">^</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>nan_error_ex</span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#000\">cpp</span><span style=\"color:#660\">:</span><span style=\"color:#066\">7</span><span style=\"color:#660\">:</span><span style=\"color:#066\">72</span><span style=\"color:#660\">:</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> note</span><span style=\"color:#660\">:</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#008\">if</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> you </span><span style=\"color:#008\">use</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#080\">&#39;-fpermissive&#39;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> G</span><span style=\"color:#660\">++</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> will accept your code</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> but allowing the </span><span style=\"color:#008\">use</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> of an undeclared name </span><span style=\"color:#008\">is</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> deprecated</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>nan_error_ex</span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#000\">cpp</span><span style=\"color:#660\">:</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#606\">In</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> instantiation of </span><span style=\"color:#080\">&#39;Type objective_function&lt;Type&gt;::operator()() [with Type = CppAD::AD&lt;double&gt;]&#39;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">:</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>C</span><span style=\"color:#660\">:</span><span style=\"color:#080\">/Users/</span><span style=\"color:#000\">POPDYN</span><span style=\"color:#660\">~</span><span style=\"color:#066\">1</span><span style=\"color:#660\">/</span><span style=\"color:#000\">DOCUME</span><span style=\"color:#660\">~</span><span style=\"color:#066\">1</span><span style=\"color:#660\">/</span><span style=\"color:#000\">R</span><span style=\"color:#660\">/</span><span style=\"color:#000\">WIN</span><span style=\"color:#660\">-</span><span style=\"color:#000\">LI</span><span style=\"color:#660\">~</span><span style=\"color:#066\">1</span><span style=\"color:#660\">/</span><span style=\"color:#066\">3.5</span><span style=\"color:#660\">/</span><span style=\"color:#000\">TMB</span><span style=\"color:#660\">/</span><span style=\"color:#000\">include</span><span style=\"color:#660\">/</span><span style=\"color:#000\">tmb_core</span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#000\">hpp</span><span style=\"color:#660\">:</span><span style=\"color:#066\">1106</span><span style=\"color:#660\">:</span><span style=\"color:#066\">7</span><span style=\"color:#660\">:</span><span style=\"color:#000\">   required </span><span style=\"color:#008\">from</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> here<br>nan_error_ex</span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#000\">cpp</span><span style=\"color:#660\">:</span><span style=\"color:#066\">7</span><span style=\"color:#660\">:</span><span style=\"color:#066\">72</span><span style=\"color:#660\">:</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> error</span><span style=\"color:#660\">:</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#080\">&#39;feenableexcept&#39;</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> was </span><span style=\"color:#008\">not</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> declared </span><span style=\"color:#008\">in</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#008\">this</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> scope<br>nan_error_ex</span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#000\">cpp</span><span style=\"color:#660\">:</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#606\">In</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> instantiation of </span><span style=\"color:#080\">&#39;Type objective_function&lt;Type&gt;::operator()() [with Type = double]&#39;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">:</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>C</span><span style=\"color:#660\">:</span><span style=\"color:#080\">/Users/</span><span style=\"color:#000\">POPDYN</span><span style=\"color:#660\">~</span><span style=\"color:#066\">1</span><span style=\"color:#660\">/</span><span style=\"color:#000\">DOCUME</span><span style=\"color:#660\">~</span><span style=\"color:#066\">1</span><span style=\"color:#660\">/</span><span style=\"color:#000\">R</span><span style=\"color:#660\">/</span><span style=\"color:#000\">WIN</span><span style=\"color:#660\">-</span><span style=\"color:#000\">LI</span><span style=\"color:#660\">~</span><span style=\"color:#066\">1</span><span style=\"color:#660\">/</span><span style=\"color:#066\">3.5</span><span style=\"color:#660\">/</span><span style=\"color:#000\">TMB</span><span style=\"color:#660\">/</span><span style=\"color:#000\">include</span><span style=\"color:#660\">/</span><span style=\"color:#000\">tmb_core</span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#000\">hpp</span><span style=\"color:#660\">:</span><span style=\"color:#066\">1330</span><span style=\"color:#660\">:</span><span style=\"color:#066\">7</span><span style=\"color:#660\">:</span><span style=\"color:#000\">   required </span><span style=\"color:#008\">from</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> here<br>nan_error_ex</span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#000\">cpp</span><span style=\"color:#660\">:</span><span style=\"color:#066\">7</span><span style=\"color:#660\">:</span><span style=\"color:#066\">72</span><span style=\"color:#660\">:</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> error</span><span style=\"color:#660\">:</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#080\">&#39;feenableexcept&#39;</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> was </span><span style=\"color:#008\">not</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> declared </span><span style=\"color:#008\">in</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#008\">this</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> scope<br></span><span style=\"color:#606\">In</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> file included </span><span style=\"color:#008\">from</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> C</span><span style=\"color:#660\">:</span><span style=\"color:#080\">/Users/</span><span style=\"color:#000\">POPDYN</span><span style=\"color:#660\">~</span><span style=\"color:#066\">1</span><span style=\"color:#660\">/</span><span style=\"color:#000\">DOCUME</span><span style=\"color:#660\">~</span><span style=\"color:#066\">1</span><span style=\"color:#660\">/</span><span style=\"color:#000\">R</span><span style=\"color:#660\">/</span><span style=\"color:#000\">WIN</span><span style=\"color:#660\">-</span><span style=\"color:#000\">LI</span><span style=\"color:#660\">~</span><span style=\"color:#066\">1</span><span style=\"color:#660\">/</span><span style=\"color:#066\">3.5</span><span style=\"color:#660\">/</span><span style=\"color:#000\">TMB</span><span style=\"color:#660\">/</span><span style=\"color:#000\">include</span><span style=\"color:#660\">/</span><span style=\"color:#000\">TMB</span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#000\">hpp</span><span style=\"color:#660\">:</span><span style=\"color:#066\">93</span><span style=\"color:#660\">:</span><span style=\"color:#066\">0</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>                 </span><span style=\"color:#008\">from</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> nan_error_ex</span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#000\">cpp</span><span style=\"color:#660\">:</span><span style=\"color:#066\">2</span><span style=\"color:#660\">:</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br><br></span></div></code></div><div><br><br></div><div>What makes the